\tag{fdip}
\taxon{Discussion}
\title{Pairing vectors and their exterior products}
\date{2026-11-17}

\p{A symmetric pairing compares two vectors in the same fiber.
For products of several vectors, alternation suggests taking the
determinant of all pairwise comparisons. Does a perfect pairing
remain perfect after this operation, including over the integers?}
